[[File:Малоярославец. Рынок.jpg|thumb|рынок|350px]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|ры́нокъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*(s)krengʰ-}}{{dercat|ru|gmh|goh|gmw-pro}}
{{dercat|ru|gmh|gem-pro}}
{{bor+|ru|pl|rynek}}, ultimately from {{der|ru|gem-pro|*hringaz||ring}}. Further from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*(s)krengʰ-||ring, circle}} (akin to {{cog|ine-pro||*krongʰ-o-}}, whence {{m+|sla-pro|*krǫgъ}}, whence {{m+|ru|круг}}), possibly from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*(s)ker-|id=turn}}. {{doublet|ru|ранг|ринг}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ры́нок}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-рынок.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|ры́нок|*|adj=ры́ночный|dim=ры́ночек}}

# [[marketplace]], [[market]]
#: {{syn|ru|база́р<q:less formal>}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[фо́ндовый]] '''ры́нок'''|[[stock market]], [[equity]] market}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[спрос]] [[на]] [[внутренний|вну́треннем]] '''ры́нке'''|demand within the domestic '''market'''}}

